  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Preserve original genus-level fossil-form target: long tapering tower, numerous rounded tightly stacked whorls, and a real rounded basal aperture. [\"Back/side proportions and interior depth require modest geometric interpolation; no photogrammetric accuracy claim\", \"No underside or interior tomography exists in selected source; model only a short recessed vestibule, not invented full internal chambers\", \"Photographic tone is fossil mineral colour, not live coloration; material is an artistic neutral bone-beige\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"target_height\": 0.026, \"target_max_width\": 0.0075, \"source\": \"Approximate image-based inference from UF181437 2 cm scale strip; not a direct specimen measurement.\", \"tolerance_fraction\": 0.12, \"other_specimen_measurement\": \"Heilprin original figure states 1.2 inches length and .25 inch width; these refer to that different figured specimen, not UF181437, and are not mixed into its dimensions.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Preserve original genus-level fossil-form target: long tapering tower, numerous rounded tightly stacked whorls, and a real rounded basal aperture. [\"Back/side proportions and interior depth require modest geometric interpolation; no photogrammetric accuracy claim\", \"No underside or interior tomography exists in selected source; model only a short recessed vestibule, not invented full internal chambers\", \"Photographic tone is fossil mineral colour, not live coloration; material is an artistic neutral bone-beige\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"target_height\": 0.026, \"target_max_width\": 0.0075, \"source\": \"Approximate image-based inference from UF181437 2 cm scale strip; not a direct specimen measurement.\", \"tolerance_fraction\": 0.12, \"other_specimen_measurement\": \"Heilprin original figure states 1.2 inches length and .25 inch width; these refer to that different figured specimen, not UF181437, and are not mixed into its dimensions.\"}"
  },
